# One API key per line, stored as plaintext:
#
# An optional label may precede the key for reference (it is ignored by
# auth):  label = your-api-key
# A bare key on its own line is also accepted (no label).
#
# Lines beginning with # or ; and blank lines are ignored.
# Keep apikeys.conf private — it should never leave the ComfyUI host.

# Example:
# my-comfyui-key = ***
